# SYS DROPMATCHFILE / FILEDROPMATCH — drop first file line containing needle
# Usability: FINDFILELINE+DROPFILELINE in one for plate/config ack-delete
# Dual of SETMATCHFILE. DROPMATCHFILEI icase. Soft no-match.

HOLD_FLASH 1

SYS TMP
LET td = LAST
SYS JOIN td "dropmatchfile_mi_fixture"
LET fix = LAST
SYS MKDIR fix

SYS JOIN fix "sample.txt"
LET fs = LAST
SYS WRITE fs "a=1\nstatus=old\nb=2\nSTATUS=keep\nc=3"

SYS DROPMATCHFILE fs "status="
ASSERT OK == 1
ASSERT DROPMATCHFILE_N == 1
ASSERT DROPMATCHFILE_I == 1
ASSERT DROPMATCHFILE_TOTAL == 4
SYS EQS LAST "status=old"
ASSERT LAST_N == 1

SYS LINEAT fs 0
SYS EQS LAST "a=1"
ASSERT LAST_N == 1
SYS LINEAT fs 1
SYS EQS LAST "b=2"
ASSERT LAST_N == 1
SYS LINEAT fs 2
SYS EQS LAST "STATUS=keep"
ASSERT LAST_N == 1

# icase drops STATUS=keep
SYS DROPMATCHFILEI fs "status="
ASSERT DROPMATCHFILE_N == 1
ASSERT DROPMATCHFILE_I == 2
SYS EQS LAST "STATUS=keep"
ASSERT LAST_N == 1
ASSERT DROPMATCHFILE_TOTAL == 3

# alias soft no-match
SYS FILEDROPMATCH fs "missing="
ASSERT OK == 1
ASSERT DROPMATCHFILE_N == 0
ASSERT DROPMATCHFILE_I == -1

# soft path miss
SYS DROPMATCHFILE "no_such_dropmatchfile_mi.txt" "x"
ASSERT OK == 0
ASSERT DROPMATCHFILE_N == 0

# cleanup
SYS RM fs

PRINT "sys_dropmatchfile ok"
